consent-s1-h3 = 1. Introduction
consent-s1-p1 = This Model Creation Consent Agreement ("Agreement") explains how <strong>ReplicaPixel</strong> ("We", "Us", "Our") will use the photographs and associated information you provide to create a personalized digital training model ("Model") for use within our service ("Service").
consent-s1-p2-prefix = By checking the box and submitting your photos and information, you ("User", "You", "Your") acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to the terms outlined in this Agreement and our
consent-link-text-privacy = Privacy Policy
