consent-s2-h3 = 2. Purpose of Data Collection
consent-s2-p1 = You are providing:
consent-s2-li1 = <strong>Photographs:</strong> Images of yourself ("Photos").
consent-s2-li2 = <strong>Personal Information:</strong> Data such as your name (or model name), age, sex, ethnicity, eye color, and other relevant attributes you provide on the creation form.
consent-s2-p2 = We collect this data for the sole purpose of creating your unique Model. This Model is designed to be used within our Service, potentially for <strong>[Briefly and accurately describe the *primary* use case - e.g., generating personalized avatar images, applying virtual try-ons, creating artistic renditions based on your likeness, etc.]</strong>.
consent-s3-h3 = 3. Grant of License and Consent
consent-s3-p1 = By uploading your Photos and providing Personal Information, you grant <strong>[Your Website/Platform Name]</strong> a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free, sublicensable license to:
consent-s3-li1 = <strong>Use, copy, process, and modify</strong> your Photos and Personal Information solely for the purpose of creating, training, refining, and storing your Model.
consent-s3-li2 = <strong>Store</strong> the uploaded Photos and the resulting Model on our secure servers or those of our trusted third-party service providers, in accordanceance with our Privacy Policy.
consent-s3-li3 = <strong>Use the Model</strong> within the Service to provide you with its intended functionalities <strong>[Reiterate or specify the main function, e.g., "to generate images based on your requests"]</strong>.
consent-s3-p2 = This license is limited to the purposes described herein and in our Privacy Policy. We will not sell your raw Photos to third parties. We will not use your Photos or identifiable likeness for general marketing or advertising purposes without obtaining separate, explicit consent from you.
consent-s4-h3 = 4. User Representations and Warranties
consent-s4-p1 = You represent and warrant that:
consent-s4-li1 = You are at least 18 years of age or the age of legal majority in your jurisdiction.
consent-s4-li2 = The Photos you upload are of you, and only you.
consent-s4-li3 = You own the rights to the Photos or have obtained all necessary permissions to grant us the license described in Section 3.
consent-s4-li4 = The Photos and Personal Information you provide do not infringe upon the copyrights, privacy rights, publicity rights, or any other rights of any third party.
consent-s4-li5 = The Personal Information you provide (age, sex, ethnicity, etc.) is accurate to the best of your knowledge.
consent-s4-li6-prefix = Your Photos do not contain illegal, explicit, hateful, or otherwise objectionable content as defined in our
