consent-s5-h3 = 5. Data Security and Privacy
consent-s5-p1-prefix = We are committed to protecting your data. We implement reasonable technical and organizational security measures to safeguard your Photos, Personal Information, and the generated Model against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. Please review our
consent-s5-p1-suffix = for detailed information on our data handling and security practices.
consent-s6-h3 = 6. Data Retention and Deletion
consent-s6-p1 = Your Photos and the generated Model will be retained as long as your account is active or as needed to provide you with the Service, unless you request deletion earlier. You can typically manage or delete your Model through your account settings <strong>[Specify how, if possible, e.g., "via the 'My Models' section"]</strong>. Deleting your Model will prevent its future use in the Service. Please refer to our Privacy Policy for more details on data retention periods and your rights regarding data deletion.
consent-s7-h3 = 7. Withdrawal of Consent
consent-s7-p1 = You have the right to withdraw this consent at any time. You can withdraw consent by <strong>[Clearly explain the process - e.g., deleting the specific Model from your account, deleting your entire account]</strong>. Upon withdrawal of consent, we will cease processing your Photos and Personal Information for Model creation based on this agreement and will take steps to delete the associated Model and Photos according to our data retention policies outlined in the Privacy Policy. Please note that withdrawal may affect your ability to use certain features of the Service that rely on the Model.
consent-s8-h3 = 8. Disclaimer
consent-s8-p1 = The Service and the Model creation process are provided "as is". We make no warranties regarding the accuracy, quality, or specific outcomes of the Model or the generated results from its use.
consent-s9-h3 = 9. Modifications to this Agreement
consent-s9-p1 = We reserve the right to modify this Agreement at any time. If we make material changes, we will notify you through the Service interface, by email, or other reasonable means before the changes take effect. Your continued use of the Model creation feature after such notification constitutes your acceptance of the revised Agreement.
